  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The avatar hide by distance feature shows a translucent \"dummy\". I would like the option to make the \"dummy\" look opaque.\n\nIn general, opacity is less demanding than translucency.\n\nBy increasing the visibility of the \"dummy\" we can, for example, keep the performance of remote enemy players in the game world with the original visibility.",
